    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37093" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέλ-ᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>driving out, expulsion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν Πεισιστρατιδέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.76
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὸς ἐκ τῆς νήσου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.88
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>marching out, expedition,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασιλέος ἐκ Θέρμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.183
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.3.1
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>charge of cavalry,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Art.</u>
				16
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
